    "body": "Keep Web 2's four work-process steps continuously visible after the previous animated reveal fix did not resolve the visitor's reported blinking.\n\nRemove the four step cards from the animation observer and remove their child reveal animation. Scope stable opacity, clipping and transforms to the process list only; other Web 2 animation and all Web 1 content/motion remain unchanged. Version Web 2 entry assets and its motion import so existing browsers request the updated files.\n\nValidation: build and 11 unit tests pass. The regression checks all three themes on desktop/mobile, waits while stationary, crosses viewport edges and revisits the section. It verifies zero step animations, stable computed styles and continued animation elsewhere in Web 2. No horizontal overflow or JavaScript errors.\n",
